            <ArticleTitle>Allergen avoidance.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1903-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Allergen exposure is a risk factor for sensitisation, prevalence and severity of allergic disease. Effective allergen avoidance strategies have been devised. The cost-benefit in public health terms should be established by prospective controlled studies that are under way around the world.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
